{"seq":3,"slug":"pharmacoeconomics","title":"大学药学 — 药物经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacy-practice/pharmacoeconomics","wordCount":2126,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学药学-药物经济学\">大学药学 — 药物经济学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>药物经济学（Pharmacoeconomics）运用经济学原理和方法，对药物治疗方案的成本和效果进行系统评估，为医疗卫生资源的合理配置提供决策依据。在医疗资源有限而需求无限的现实约束下，药物经济学帮助回答一个关键问题：&quot;这笔钱花得值不值？&quot;它不仅用于新药的定价和医保准入谈判，还用于指导临床治疗方案的选择和卫生政策的制定。中国国家医保药品目录谈判已将药物经济学评价作为核心参考依据。</p>\n<p>核心分析方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>成本-效果分析（CEA）</strong>：以自然单位衡量效果（如治愈率、血压达标率）</li>\n<li><strong>成本-效用分析（CUA）</strong>：以质量调整生命年（QALY）衡量效果</li>\n<li><strong>成本-效益分析（CBA）</strong>：将效果货币化，直接与成本比较</li>\n<li><strong>最小成本分析（CMA）</strong>：效果相同时比较总成本</li>\n<li><strong>预算影响分析（BIA）</strong>：评估新药纳入支付体系的财务影响</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-成本的分类与测量\">一、成本的分类与测量</h3><p>药物经济学中的&quot;成本&quot;远不止药品价格，而是涵盖整个治疗过程中消耗的所有资源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接医疗成本</td>\n<td>医疗服务直接消耗的资源</td>\n<td>药品费、检验费、住院费、手术费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接非医疗成本</td>\n<td>因就医产生的非医疗支出</td>\n<td>交通费、陪护费、营养费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间接成本</td>\n<td>因疾病导致的生产力损失</td>\n<td>误工收入损失、早逝导致的社会损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐性成本</td>\n<td>难以量化的成本</td>\n<td>疼痛、焦虑、生活质量下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成本的测量需要注意时间维度——未来发生的成本需要通过贴现（discounting）折算为现值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PV = \\frac{FV}{(1 + r)^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 为现值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FV</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 为未来值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 为贴现率（中国通常采用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\% \\sim 5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为年数。长期治疗方案的经济评价中，贴现对结果的影响可能非常显著。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-成本-效果分析-cea\">二、成本-效果分析（CEA）</h3><p>CEA 是最常用的药物经济学方法。它比较不同治疗方案的增量成本-效果比（ICER）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>新方案</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>对照方案</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>新方案</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>对照方案</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ICER = \\frac{C_{\\text{新方案}} - C_{\\text{对照方案}}}{E_{\\text{新方案}} - E_{\\text{对照方案}}} = \\frac{\\Delta C}{\\Delta E}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">新方案</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">对照方案</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">新方案</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">对照方案</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>ICER 的含义是：与对照方案相比，每多获得一个单位的效果，需要额外付出多少成本。</p>\n<p>成本-效果平面将分析结果分布于四个象限：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"quadrantChart\" data-source=\"quadrantChart&#10;    title 成本-效果平面&#10;    x-axis &quot;效果更差&quot; --&gt; &quot;效果更好&quot;&#10;    y-axis &quot;成本更低&quot; --&gt; &quot;成本更高&quot;&#10;    quadrant-1 &quot;右上: 成本更高效果更好&quot;&#10;    quadrant-2 &quot;左上: 成本更高效果更差&quot;&#10;    quadrant-3 &quot;左下: 成本更低效果更差&quot;&#10;    quadrant-4 &quot;右下: 成本更低效果更好&quot;\">quadrantChart\n    title 成本-效果平面\n    x-axis \"效果更差\" --&gt; \"效果更好\"\n    y-axis \"成本更低\" --&gt; \"成本更高\"\n    quadrant-1 \"右上: 成本更高效果更好\"\n    quadrant-2 \"左上: 成本更高效果更差\"\n    quadrant-3 \"左下: 成本更低效果更差\"\n    quadrant-4 \"右下: 成本更低效果更好\"</pre><p>右下象限（成本低+效果好）为绝对优势方案；左上象限（成本高+效果差）应被淘汰；右上象限需要判断 ICER 是否低于意愿支付阈值（WTP）。</p>\n<p>中国的 WTP 阈值参考标准通常为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\sim 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 倍人均 GDP/QALY。以 2024 年人均 GDP 约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 万元计算，WTP 范围约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9 \\sim 27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span></span></span></span></span> 万元/QALY。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-成本-效用分析-cua\">三、成本-效用分析（CUA）</h3><p>CUA 是 CEA 的特殊形式，使用 QALY 作为效果指标。QALY 同时反映生存时间和生活质量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">QALY = \\sum_{t=1}^{T} q_t \\times \\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 时段的效用值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> 死亡，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 =</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> 完全健康），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为时间长度。</p>\n<p>效用值的测量方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>直接测量法</strong>：时间权衡法（TTO）、标准博弈法（SG）、视觉模拟量表（VAS）</li>\n<li><strong>间接测量法</strong>：使用多维健康量表（EQ-5D、SF-6D）评估健康状态，再通过群体效用值表转换</li>\n</ul>\n<p>EQ-5D-5L 包含五个维度：行动能力、自我照顾、日常活动、疼痛/不适、焦虑/抑郁，每个维度五个等级。中国版 EQ-5D 效用值量表已经建立，可将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3125</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3125</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3125</span></span></span></span></span> 种健康状态映射为效用值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-敏感性分析\">四、敏感性分析</h3><p>由于经济评价中的参数存在不确定性，敏感性分析是验证结果稳健性的必要步骤：</p>\n<p><strong>单因素敏感性分析</strong>：逐一变化每个参数的取值（通常为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> 置信区间），观察 ICER 的变化。结果通常以龙卷风图（tornado diagram）呈现。</p>\n<p><strong>概率敏感性分析（PSA）</strong>：为所有参数赋予概率分布（如成本用 Gamma 分布，效用值用 Beta 分布，相对危险度用 Lognormal 分布），通过 Monte Carlo 模拟（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 次）获得 ICER 的分布。结果以成本-效果可接受曲线（CEAC）呈现——显示在不同 WTP 阈值下，新方案具有成本-效果优势的概率。</p>\n<p><strong>情景分析</strong>：针对关键假设（如研究视角、时间范围、贴现率）设定不同情景，评估假设变化对结论的影响。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-药物经济学在医保决策中的应用\">五、药物经济学在医保决策中的应用</h3><p>中国国家医保药品目录谈判流程中，药物经济学评价占据核心地位：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>参与者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>企业提交</td>\n<td>药物经济学评价报告+预算影响分析</td>\n<td>制药企业</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专家评审</td>\n<td>审核分析方法、参数来源、结论合理性</td>\n<td>药经专家组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测算底价</td>\n<td>基于 ICER 和 BIA 测算医保可承受价格</td>\n<td>测算专家组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格谈判</td>\n<td>企业报价与底价之间的谈判</td>\n<td>谈判组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准入决策</td>\n<td>最终确定是否纳入目录及支付标准</td>\n<td>医保局</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>预算影响分析（BIA）预测新药纳入医保后对基金支出的影响，通常以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\sim 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 年为时间范围，考虑目标患者人数、药物替代效应和市场份额变化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-真实世界研究与药物经济学\">六、真实世界研究与药物经济学</h3><p>传统药物经济学评价多基于临床试验数据建模，但临床试验的严格入排标准使结果可能不完全适用于真实临床情境。真实世界研究（RWS）利用电子病历、医保数据库、患者登记等真实世界数据（RWD），提供更贴近临床实践的经济评价证据。</p>\n<p>真实世界数据的来源：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>医保结算数据库：覆盖面广，包含费用和诊断信息</li>\n<li>医院 HIS/EMR 系统：包含详细的临床数据</li>\n<li>患者自报结局（PRO）：直接反映生活质量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>药物 A 的年治疗成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 万元，获得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> QALY；药物 B 的年治疗成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 万元，获得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.45</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.45</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.45</span></span></span></span></span> QALY。计算药物 A 相对于药物 B 的 ICER。若 WTP 阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 万元/QALY，药物 A 是否具有成本-效果优势？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释为什么在药物经济学评价中需要对未来成本和效果进行贴现。如果贴现率从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3%</span></span></span></span></span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>，对长期治疗方案的评价结果会产生什么方向的影响？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一项新型抗肿瘤药物的 PSA 结果显示：在 WTP <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 万元/QALY 时，该药具有成本-效果优势的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>62</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">62\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">62%</span></span></span></span></span>。讨论这一结果是否足以支持将该药纳入医保目录。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>比较 CEA 和 CBA 的优缺点。为什么药物经济学评价中较少使用 CBA？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某慢性病药物从原研药切换为仿制药后价格降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span>。讨论如何使用最小成本分析（CMA）评估这一替换的经济性，以及需要满足什么前提条件。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>《药物经济学》</strong>（孙利华主编）：国内药物经济学核心教材</li>\n<li><strong>《中国药物经济学评价指南》（2020版）</strong>：方法学规范的权威指南</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;Pharmacoeconomics: From Theory to Practice&quot; (Arnold)</strong>：英文入门教材</li>\n<li><strong>ISPOR (International Society for Pharmacoeconomics and Outcomes Research)</strong>：国际药物经济学学会，提供丰富的方法学资源</li>\n<li><strong>中国药物经济学</strong> 期刊：发表国内药物经济学研究的专业期刊</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>药物经济学为医疗决策提供了量化分析工具。CEA 和 CUA 通过 ICER 将成本与效果关联，使不同治疗方案之间的经济性比较有了客观标准。敏感性分析验证了结论的稳健性，预算影响分析则从支付方角度评估可承受性。在中国医保谈判制度下，药物经济学评价已成为新药定价和准入的必要环节。药学专业人员掌握药物经济学方法，既能在临床实践中促进合理用药，也能为医疗卫生政策制定贡献专业视角。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学药学 — 药物经济学","id":"大学药学-药物经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、成本的分类与测量","id":"一-成本的分类与测量"},{"level":3,"text":"二、成本-效果分析（CEA）","id":"二-成本-效果分析-cea"},{"level":3,"text":"三、成本-效用分析（CUA）","id":"三-成本-效用分析-cua"},{"level":3,"text":"四、敏感性分析","id":"四-敏感性分析"},{"level":3,"text":"五、药物经济学在医保决策中的应用","id":"五-药物经济学在医保决策中的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"六、真实世界研究与药物经济学","id":"六-真实世界研究与药物经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学药学 — 药品监管与法规","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/pharmacy/pharmacy-practice/drug-regulation"},"next":null}